cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Facet-0 or ManuFacet-1K in your research, please cite the paper below."
title: "Facet-0: A Robotic Foundation Model for Contact-Rich Precise Manipulation"
abstract: >-
  Facet-0 is a robotic foundation model for contact-rich precise manipulation. It
  unifies multimodal representation learning and reinforcement-learning
  post-training around a joint action-wrench proposal, and is trained on
  ManuFacet-1K, a 1,000-hour force-synchronized manipulation corpus.
